### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:scene1 a ex:Scene ;
    ex:contains ex:YellowTaxi, ex:Road, ex:RainCondition .

ex:YellowTaxi a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasSpeed "30 km/h" ;
    ex:hasLicensePlate "CARLA" ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:RedCar .

ex:RedCar a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasSpeed "25 km/h" ;
    ex:hasLicensePlate "UNKNOWN" .

ex:Road a ex:Infrastructure ;
    ex:hasCondition ex:WetSurface .

ex:WetSurface a ex:Condition ;
    ex:describedAs "Wet due to rain" .

ex:RainCondition a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:hasVisibility "Low" ;
    ex:hasIntensity "Heavy" .
```

### Identified Risks for each risk class

